            <title>0.6.16</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:03:56 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>145</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New
- **Repository shortcuts in the terminal header.** Next to the path: Copy Path, Open in Finder, and the repository's web page when it has a browsable remote. They act on the task's worktree when it runs in one.

### Changed
- **PiG is no longer a separate agent.** Tasks and projects that used PiG now run as Pi; their sessions are kept and resume as before. The PiG settings tab is gone.
- The board toolbar has only the Open In menu; the separate "Open in <editor>" button is gone.

### Fixed
- OpenCode sessions show their real turn count, and long OpenCode sessions are read in full for the info line and for Migrate to.
]]></description>
